  "description": "The Taïga is a trail-focused hardtail, perfectly suited for bikepacking. It is a versatile frame developed to cover long distances, climb efficiently, and remain stable when the terrain turns technical. In short, the Taïga is a refined steel bike you’ll be happy to return to season after season.\n\nEqually at home on daily trail rides or multi-day adventures, the Taïga climbs exceptionally well, delivers precise handling in technical sections, and inspires confidence on demanding descents. It is optimized for 120 to 140 mm suspension forks for efficiency, performance, and comfort.\n\nBuilt from Reynolds 725 steel, the frame uses butted tubing to reduce weight while maximizing strength. Each frame size receives a size-specific tube selection, ensuring optimal performance while preserving the lively ride quality and comfort that steel is known for.\n\nIf you’re looking for a simple yet progressive hardtail that solves trail challenges, adapts effortlessly to bikepacking, and gives you confidence when the terrain gets rough, the Taïga is built for you. Owning a bike you genuinely love to ride makes all the difference, and this is exactly that bike.",
